Frame-relative test input/capture and bounded gameplay measurement markers.
Reuse the existing guest frame counter; no simulation, audio-clock or player-save changes.
f<N> timestamps and durations are guest frames; existing wall/g timestamps remain.
Integration: fix-chore patch 70-frame-aligned-tests, regenerated on the PR 26 chain (same change, new context).

